    <h2 class="h-sec">Traditional wisdom, <span class="it" style="color:var(--teal)">simple ritual.</span></h2>
    <p>Triphala — “three fruits” — is among the most trusted formulations in Ayurveda. It combines Amalaki, Haritaki and Bibhitaki in a single powder and is traditionally taken with warm water before bed.</p><p>Veda Apothecary Triphala Powder is a pure three-fruit blend with nothing else added. Its tangy, slightly bitter, astringent taste is the natural flavor of the fruits.</p>
    <h3 class="h-sub">How to build the ritual</h3>
    <ol class="steps-list"><li><b>Warm water, slowly.</b> Stir 1 teaspoon into a cup of warm water, let it rest for a minute and sip.</li><li><b>Soften the taste.</b> Add a little honey once the water has cooled slightly.</li><li><b>Ask if unsure.</b> If you have a digestive condition or take medication, speak with a healthcare professional before use.</li></ol>
    <p class="disc-inline"><b>*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</b> Consult a healthcare professional before use, especially if you are pregnant, nursing, or taking medication.</p>
